Based on the search results, here are the three most relevant pages for Symfony Messenger component documentation:

1. **Messenger: Sync & Queued Message Handling** (https://symfony.com/doc/current/messenger.html) - The main official documentation page covering how to use Symfony Messenger for both synchronous and asynchronous message handling with queues.

2. **The Messenger Component** (https://symfony.com/doc/7.3/components/messenger.html) - The component-specific documentation that explains how the Messenger component helps applications send and receive messages to/from other applications or via message queues.

3. **Messenger component** (https://symfony.com/packages/messenger) - The official Symfony package page for Messenger that provides links to documentation, source code, and installation instructions via Composer.

